      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "d19-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Juniper Telecom — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Juniper Telecom — Q3 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d19-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d19-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Juniper Telecom closed Q3 2025 with two platform migrations and a reorganisation of the support function. As a company focused on fixed wireless broadband, the leadership team tracked regional performance, headcount, pricing, service levels and vendor spend against the annual plan, all of which are detailed in the sections that follow.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d19-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Scheduler platform is owned by the Platform team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Nadia Haddad, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 80.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d19-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Operational KPIs are refreshed weekly on the internal dashboard; this document is the quarterly point-in-time snapshot.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 98.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d19-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 116.3
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d19-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 130.7
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
    },
