        {
          "id": "d19-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Looking ahead to Q4 2025, management expects stable churn and a step-up in enterprise pipeline. Capital expenditure for Q4 2025 is budgeted at $22.2M, the majority allocated to edge infrastructure.",
